# The parent enclosure/.gitignore excludes *.stl and *.3mf as build output.
# This folder's print files ARE committed, as in the retro and kitten
# folders (2026-10-29): until then none of them was in git, so a fresh clone
# had none, and `git clean -X` would have deleted the only copies.
#
# They are still generated, not authored. If you change the .scad, re-export
# and commit both together, or the mesh silently stops matching the source.
!*.stl
# The arc's two-colour project, built from two of the STLs (make-arc-3mf.py).
!control_arc_twotone.3mf
